  "question": {
    "text": "The coefficient of restitution between a snooker ball and the side cushion is <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>3</mn></mfrac></math>. If the ball hits the cushion and then rebounds at right angles to its original direction, then what is the angle made with the side cushion by the direction of motion before and after impact?"
  },
